-05-03T09:03:55Z","currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-08-06T07:21:07Z","releaseNotes":"We're changing for you! Update the app for an even better experience, discover the best offers, and enjoy your visits to Circle K stations!","primaryGenreName":"Shopping","primaryGenreId":6024,"version":"4.9.2","wrapperType":"software","currency":"NOK","description":"Circle K in countries: Norway, Denmark, Sweden, Poland, Lithuania, Latvia, Estonia\n\nOn the road? Our app has you covered! Enjoy a range of digital services that keep evolving to give you the best Circle K experience - all in one place. We’ve also improved our loyalty program, Circle K extra! Your fuel and charging discounts now depend on how often you visit—whether it’s for fuel, charging, snacks, or just a coffee. Plus, you get to choose your own reward every 5th visit!\n-\tTrack your progress and rewards in Circle K extra View your discount level, pick personalized rewards, and easily manage your purchase history, linked cards, and communication preferences.\n-\tPay with our app at the pump Pay for fuel quickly and securely in the app.\n-\tNeed a car wash? No problem! Use the app to wash your car at your nearest Circle K and keep it sparkling clean.\n-\tCar wash subscriptions Sign in or sign up for flexible wash programs to suit every need.\n-\tFind your nearest station Locate Circle K stations and filter by services like car wash, EV charging and more.\n\nCircle K in Germany, Belgium and Luxembourg:\n\nWith the Circle K App, you have everything you need on the go: Quickly find Circle K stations, TotalEnergies branded station, as well as stations from participating partners within the acceptance network, discover current in-station offers, and enjoy the benefits of the Reward Club – all in one app.\nAdd your Reward Card digitally and enjoy exclusive benefits anytime, without carrying a physical card. Whether you’re commuting or traveling, the Circle K App supports you on every journey.\n\nYour benefits at a glance:\n-\tOverview of Circle K stations and participating partner stations\n-\tAdd your Reward Card digitally in the app\n-\tEnjoy all benefits of the Reward Club\n-\tDiscover current offers and promotions at stations\n-\tMini Games\nThe Circle K App – simple, practical, and always with you.\n\nCircle K expands its network\nIn 2023, Alimentation Couche-Tard acquired the TotalEnergies station network in Germany and the Netherlands, while taking a stake acquisition in Belgium and Luxembourg, expanding its European presence by nearly 2,200 locations.\nFuel will continue to be offered under the TotalEnergies brand for the time being, while Circle K services and upgrades are introduced gradually. Alimentation Couche-Tard is a global leader in convenience and mobility, with nearly 17,300 stores in 29 countries and over 5,200 stations across Europe under the Circle K and INGO brands.","averageUserRating":4.59304,"contentAdvisoryRating":"4+","languageCodesISO2A":["DA","NL","EN","ET","FR","DE","LV","LT","NB","PL","SV"],"fileSizeBytes":"133691392","formattedPrice":"Free","userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":27435,"trackContentRating":"4+","trackCensoredName":"Circle K","trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/no/app/circle-k/id1106837687?uo=4","sellerName":"Circle K AS","userRatingCount":27435}